/skills/xmars-continuous-forge/scripts/xmars_forge.py <subcommand> [flags]`\n23: \n24: ### Available Subcommands\n25: \n26: | Subcommand | Description | Key Options |\n27: |------------|-------------|-------------|\n28: | `status` | Query Gateway (8085), tunnel, training corpus count, and supervisor health | `--port 8085`, `--output <file>` |\n29: | `train` | Run synthetic ingestion and triad distillation cycles on demand | `--cycles <n>`, `--output <file>` |\n30: | `review` | Evaluate a code/doc artifact using Blackbox Review Engine | `<target_path>`, `--output <file>` |\n31: | `supervisor` | Inspect recent cycles and health of the 24/7 autonomous supervisor | `--tail <n>`, `--output <file>` |\n32: | `dispatch` | Send an instruction or task to an agent node with optional neural speech | `<message>`, `--agent <name>`, `--speak`, `--output <file>` |\n33: \n34: ---\n35: \n36: ## Usage Examples\n37: \n38: ### 1. Check Full Sovereign System Telemetry\n39: ```bash\n40: python .agents/skills/xmars-continuous-forge/scripts/xmars_forge.py status --output memory/agent_logs/forge_status.json\n41: ```\n42: \n43: ### 2. Trigger On-Demand Hyper-Accelerated Synthetic Training\n44: ```bash\n45: python .agents/skills/xmars-continuous-forge/scripts/xmars_forge.py train --cycles 1 --output memory/agent_logs/forge_train_result.json\n46: ```\n47: \n48: ### 3. Run Blackbox Review Engine\n49: ```bash\n50: python .agents/skills/xmars-continuous-forge/scripts/xmars_forge.py review ops/training/continuous_training_daemon.py --output memory/agent_logs/vance_audit.json\n51: ```\n52: \n53: ### 4. Inspect 24/7 Autonomous Supervisor Telemetry\n54: ```bash\n55: python .agents/skills/xmars-continuous-forge/scripts/xmars_forge.py supervisor --tail 5\n56: ```\n57: \n58: ### 5. Dispatch Direct Task with Neural Studio Speech\n59: ```bash\n60: python .agents/skills/xmars-continuous-forge/scripts/xmars_forge.py dispatch \"Audit all active telemetry streams\" --agent Jarvis --speak\n61: ```\n62: \n63: ---\n64: \n65: ## Guidelines & Best Practices\n66: \n67: 1. **Output Redirection**: Always provide `--output <path>` when running inside automated scripts or agent invocations to preserve context space and log receipts canonically in `memory/agent_logs/`.\n68: 2. **Infrastructure Protection**: The core governance assets (`identity/charter.yaml`, `identity/lead9_roster.json`, `Xoras_agent_cards/`, `core_agents/`) are immutable and frozen under Log Entry #076.\n69: 3. **Audio Dispatch**: When `--speak` is enabled, the command uses Edge-TTS studio neural synthesis (`en-US-ChristopherNeural`, `en-US-GuyNeural`, etc.) with local Kokoro ONNX fallback.\n70: 4. **Autonomous Cadence**: The background supervisor runs on a strict 180s minimum interval to prevent GPU/CPU thrashing.\n71: \nThe above content shows the entire, complete file contents of the requested file.\n"}
